Value Required LICENSE (\S+)
Value ENTITLEMENT_TAG (.*?)
Value COUNT (\d+)
Value STATUS (\S(?:.*?\S)?)

Start
  ^\s*License\s+Usage:\s*$$ -> UsageHeader
  ^\s*$$
  ^.*$$

UsageHeader
  ^\s*License\s+Entitlement\s+[Tt]ag\s+Count\s+Status\s*$$ -> Usage
  ^\s*$$
  ^.*$$

Usage
  ^\s*-+\s*$$
  ^\s*${LICENSE}\s+${ENTITLEMENT_TAG}\s{2,}${COUNT}\s+${STATUS}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^.*$$
